<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rdf:RDF xmlns:cc="http://creativecommons.org/ns#" xmlns:dct="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:adms="http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#" xmlns:foaf="http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/" xmlns:odrl="http://www.w3.org/ns/odrl/2/" xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" xmlns:dcat="http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#" xmlns:lcon="http://www.w3.org/ns/locn#" xmlns:sioc="http://rdfs.org/sioc/ns#" xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xmlns:prov="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#" xmlns:skos="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xmlns:schema="http://schema.org/" xmlns:v="http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#" xmlns:vann="http://purl.org/vocab/vann/" xmlns:voaf="http://purl.org/vocommons/voaf#" xmlns:wdrs="http://www.w3.org/2007/05/powder-s#" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#" xmlns:spdx="http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#" xmlns:time="http://www.w3.org/2006/time#" xmlns:dcatap="http://data.europa.eu/r5r/" xmlns:stat="http://data.europa.eu/s1n/statdcat-ap/" xmlns:qb="http://purl.org/linked-data/cube#" ><dcat:Dataset rdf:about="http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/products-datasets/-/tepsr_sp410"><dct:issued rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2017-04-26</dct:issued><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Zeitliche Frequenz</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Time frequency</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Fréquence (relative au temps)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Geopolitische Meldeeinheit</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Geopolitical entity (reporting)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Entité géopolitique (déclarante)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Indikator zur Informationsgesellschaft</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Information society indicator</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Indicateur sur la société de l&apos;information</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Art der Einzelpersonen</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Individual type</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Type de particulier</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Maßeinheit</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Unit of measure</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Unité de mesure</dcat:keyword><dct:type><skos:Concept  rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/dataset-type/STATISTICAL"/></dct:type><dct:title xml:lang="en">Individuals who have basic or above basic overall digital skills by sex</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="en">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The Digital Skills Indicator 2.0 (DSI) is a composite indicator which is based on selected activities related to internet or software use that individuals aged 16-74 perform in five specific areas (Information and data literacy, Communication and collaboration, Digital content creation, Safety, and Problem solving). It is assumed that individuals having performed certain activities have the corresponding skills. Therefore, the indicators can be considered as proxy of individuals digital skills. The indicator is based on the EU survey on the use of ICT in households and by individuals.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; The DSI methodology has been changed substantially in 2021 to reflect the Digital Competence Framework 2.0. As a consequence, 2021 is the beginning of a new time series. Data for the years before 2021 are available through the previous indicator (&lt;a href=&quot;https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/bookmark/21158d29-bc72-46b4-bf04-ab1469865fe5?lang=en&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;ISOC_SK_DSKL_I)&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</dct:description><dct:title xml:lang="fr">Particuliers ayant de compétences numériques générales de base ou plus avancées par sexe</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="fr">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;L&apos;indicateur des compétences numériques est un indicateur composite fondé sur une sélection d’activités sur internet réalisées par des particuliers âgées de 16 à 74 dans cinq domaines spécifiques (l&apos;information, la communication, la résolution de problèmes et les logiciels, la sécurité). &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;On suppose que les particuliers ayant exercé certaines activités possèdent les compétences correspondantes. Par conséquent, les indicateurs peuvent être considérés comme une approximation des compétences numériques des particuliers. Les données de cet indicateur proviennent de l’enquête de l’UE sur l’utilisation des TIC (technologies de l’information et de la communication) dans les ménages et les particuliers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;La méthodologie concernant l&apos;indicateur des compétences numériques a été considérablement modifiée en 2021 pour refléter le ‘Digital Competence Framework 2.0’. En conséquence, 2021 constitue le début d&apos;une nouvelle série chronologique. Les données pour les années antérieures à 2021 sont disponibles via l&apos;indicateur précédent (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/bookmark/21158d29-bc72-46b4-bf04-ab1469865fe5?lang=fr&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;ISOC_SK_DSKL_I&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</dct:description><dct:title xml:lang="de">Personen, die insgesamt grundlegende oder höhere als grundlegende digitale Kenntnisse haben nach Geschlecht</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="de">&lt;p&gt;Der Digital Skills Indikator 2.0 (DSI) ist ein zusammengesetzter Indikator, der auf der Grundlage ausgewählter Aktivitäten im Zusammenhang mit der Internet- oder Softwarenutzung von Einzelpersonen im Alter von 16-74 Jahren in fünf spezifischen Bereichen (Information und Datenkompetenz, Kommunikation und Zusammenarbeit, Erstellung digitaler Inhalte, Sicherheit und Problemlösung) berechnet wird. Es wird davon ausgegangen, dass Personen, die bestimmte Tätigkeiten ausgeübt haben, auch über die entsprechenden Fähigkeiten verfügen. Daher können die Indikatoren als Näherungswert für die digitalen Kompetenzen des Einzelnen angesehen werden. Der Indikator basiert auf der EU-Erhebung zur Nutzung von IKT in Haushalten und durch Einzelpersonen.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Die DSI-Methodik wurde 2021 grundlegend geändert, um das Digital Competence Framework 2.0 widerzuspiegeln. Damit ist 2021 der Beginn einer neuen Zeitreihe. Daten für die Jahre vor 2021 sind über den vorherigen Indikator (&lt;a href=&quot;https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/bookmark/21158d29-bc72-46b4-bf04-ab1469865fe5?lang=de&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;ISOC_SK_DSKL_I&lt;/a&gt;) verfügbar.&lt;/p&gt;</dct:description><dct:identifier>tepsr_sp410</dct:identifier><foaf:page rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/tepsr_sp410"/><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/EUR"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/BEL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/BGR"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/CZE"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/DNK"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/DEU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/EST"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/IRL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/GRC"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ESP"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/FRA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/HRV"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ITA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/CYP"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LVA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LTU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LUX"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/HUN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/MLT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/NLD"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/AUT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/POL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/PRT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ROU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SVN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SVK"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/FIN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SWE"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ISL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LIE"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/NOR"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/CHE"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/GBR"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/BIH"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/MNE"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/MKD"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ALB"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SRB"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/TUR"/></dct:spatial><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/FREQ" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Zeitliche Frequenz</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Time frequency</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Fréquence (relative au temps)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/GEO" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Geopolitische Meldeeinheit</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Geopolitical entity (reporting)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entité géopolitique (déclarante)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Indikator zur Informationsgesellschaft</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Information society indicator</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Indicateur sur la société de l&apos;information</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/IND_TYPE" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Art der Einzelpersonen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Individual type</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Type de particulier</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/UNIT" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Maßeinheit</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Unit of measure</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Unité de mesure</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:attribute> <qb:AttributeProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/OBS_FLAG" /> </stat:attribute><stat:attribute> <qb:AttributeProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/CONF_STATUS" /> </stat:attribute><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=I_DSK2_BAB"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Personen, die insgesamt grundlegende oder höher als grundlegende digitale Kenntnisse haben (alle fünf Teilindikatoren sind grundlegend oder höher als grundlegend)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Individuals with basic or above basic overall digital skills (all five component indicators are at basic or above basic level)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Particuliers ayant des compétences numériques générales de base ou avancées (toutes les cinq composantes de l&apos;indicateur composite sont de niveau de base ou avancé)</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/UNIT?code=PC_IND"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Prozent der Personen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Percentage of individuals</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Pourcentage des particuliers</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:numSeries rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">111</stat:numSeries><dcat:theme><skos:Concept rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ECON" /></dcat:theme><dcat:theme><skos:Concept rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI" /></dcat:theme><dcat:theme><skos:Concept rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TECH" /></dcat:theme><dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2024-12-17</dct:modified><dct:accrualPeriodicity><dct:Frequency rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"/></dct:accrualPeriodicity><dct:temporal><dct:PeriodOfTime rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/PeriodOfTime/3169a64b-f3b3-4920-b709-b32c20b97678"><dcat:startDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2021-01-01</dcat:startDate><dcat:endDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2023-12-31</dcat:endDate></dct:PeriodOfTime></dct:temporal><dct:accessRights><dct:RightsStatement rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"/></dct:accessRights><dcat:landingPage><foaf:Document rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/tepsr_sp410"><dct:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/documentation-type/WEBPAGE_RELATED"/><schema:url xml:lang="en">https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/tepsr_sp410</schema:url><dct:title xml:lang="en">More information on Eurostat Website</dct:title><dct:title xml:lang="fr">Plus d&apos;information sur le site web d&apos;Eurostat</dct:title><dct:title xml:lang="de">Mehr Informationen auf der Eurostat Website</dct:title></foaf:Document></dcat:landingPage><foaf:page><foaf:Document rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/cache/metadata/en/isoc_sk_dskl_i21_esmsip2.htm"><dct:title xml:lang="en">ESMS metadata (Euro-SDMX Metadata structure) HTML</dct:title><foaf:topic rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/tepsr_sp410"/><schema:url xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/cache/metadata/en/isoc_sk_dskl_i21_esmsip2.htm]]></schema:url><dct:format rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/HTML"/><dcat:mediaType rdf:resource="http://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/text/html"/><dct:type><skos:Concept rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/documentation-type/DOCUMENTATION_MAIN"/></dct:type></foaf:Document></foaf:page><foaf:page><foaf:Document rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/files?file=metadata/isoc_sk_dskl_i21_esmsip2.sdmx.zip"><dct:title xml:lang="en">ESMS metadata (Euro-SDMX Metadata structure) SDMX</dct:title><foaf:topic rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/tepsr_sp410"/><schema:url xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/files?file=metadata/isoc_sk_dskl_i21_esmsip2.sdmx.zip]]></schema:url><dct:format rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/XML"/><dca